<title>BELGIUM: EU continues suspension of molasses import duties.</title>
<headline>EU continues suspension of molasses import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee continued the suspension of molasses import duties at zero on Wednesday, an EU member state official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The committee set the cif reference price for cane molasses at 8.37 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 8.54 Ecus the previous week.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for beet molasses was set at 12.21 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 12.35 Ecus the previous week, the official said.</p>
</text>
